Z||000070||Stage-2GT||07-28-2001||09:31 AM|||| You know, one the things I hate most in this world, is jealousy. Now they say a picture is worth a thousand words and I don't feel like typing that long. So, Santa Cruzer, to explain Fierobabys comments, just look at this and answer one small and EASY question: Where would you want to be tonight???<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fierobaby.jpg">    <BR>Fierobaby?<P>OR<P>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/hotchic_1.gif">    <P>I think the decision is clear. Good jod Santa Cruzer!!!<P><BR>S2GT    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif"><P>Stupid people bother me!<P><BR>[This message has been edited by Stage-2GT (edited 07-28-2001).]<P>[This message has been edited by Stage-2GT (edited 07-28-2001).]<p>[This message has been edited by Stage-2GT (edited 07-28-2001).]||||reg||13
Z||000071||Songman||07-28-2001||10:23 AM||||People are just getting mean on the forum with their personal insults on people's appearance. Like the guy who said elsewhere "My girlfriend says you are a dweeb" (paraphrased).<P>And this looks like an attempt to slam Fierobaby. Well, personally I'd rather be with Fierobaby because she is real. Even if this is Santa Cruzer's girlfriend, which I doubt but don't really care, look at her! This girl thinks she is some hot piece of work and they think that going out and acting stupid makes them cool. As they get a little older and get tired of throwing up on each other they will realize that this is just not true. Personally, I would rather spend my time with someone I can talk to and enjoy 'real' times with other than someone who thinks life is all about when is the next party.<P>That is just me... to each his own. Sorry to say all of this, but I don't like to see nice people being attacked. Especially if it is a personal attack about their appearance. Someday you people will grow up and see that there is much more important in life than looks... and if FieroKid will allow me to say it, I think Corinne is cute anyway...<BR>Since I am more than double her age I am not trying to pick her up.. just don't like mean people.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/songman_1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A>||||reg||8
Z||000072||Stage-2GT||07-28-2001||10:35 AM||||  Hold up Cowboy, your getting your hackles up for nothing. If you go back to the first page, you'll see that Fierobaby is guilty of exactly what you are saying. My point, don't insult others unless you are prepared to be insulted yourself. I could care less who's GF is who's. For all we know really, that wasn't your GF in the picture, we have to take your word for it. Just relax bro.<BR> Also, as for the throwing up on each other, well, I would bet that most of us Adults here are as guilty of that as these younger people are. Or have we forgotten our rowdy and sensless youth? <BR> Look Songman, maybe you got up on the wrong side this morning, I don't know. I have always respected your opinions ans comments. Hopefully you can see my point in this. I hate it when people start people bashing for no reason. What so you suppose Fierobabys reason was??? <P><BR>Well I think the reason Fierobaby(my girl) said what she said is cuzz we have been together now for almost 6 months. Most relationships wont even go that long.<BR>Scott<P>IP: Logged<BR> <BR>fierobaby<BR>Member <BR>Posts: 440<BR>From:Berea, Ohio, USA<BR>Registered: Jun 2001 <BR>  posted 07-24-2001 12:07 PM                 <BR>--------------------------------------------------------------------------------<BR>actually the reason I said it was cause who cares... well at leastI don't care...the guy who posted that is annoying so I thought I would be annyoing and rude back. we have all asked him repeated times to change his sig pic cause its HUGE and he hasn't granted he didn't post it here...but still annoying all the same... now don't assume what I ment when typing somethign cause chances are you're wrong <BR> <BR>See what I mean. Now that was just mean. She is apparently perusing this guys threads in some sort or vendetta.<P><BR>------------------<BR>"If Hate Was Money, I Would Own The World"<P>[This message has been edited by Stage-2GT (edited 07-28-2001).]<p>[This message has been edited by Stage-2GT (edited 07-28-2001).]||||reg||12
