Z||000074||Songman||07-28-2001||10:58 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Stage-2GT:<BR><B>  Hold up Cowboy, your getting your hackles up for nothing. If you go back to the first page, you'll see that Fierobaby is guilty of exactly what you are saying. My point, don't insult others unless you are prepared to be insulted yourself. I could care less who's GF is who's. For all we know really, that wasn't your GF in the picture, we have to take your word for it. Just relax bro.<BR> Also, as for the throwing up on each other, well, I would bet that most of us Adults here are as guilty of that as these younger people are. Or have we forgotten our rowdy and sensless youth? <BR> Look Songman, maybe you got up on the wrong side this morning, I don't know. I have always respected your opinions ans comments. Hopefully you can see my point in this. I hate it when people start people bashing for no reason. What so you suppose Fierobabys reason was??? <BR>  </B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>My comments here are about people making personal jabs at people's appearance. What I saw early on in this thread was a doubt as to whether this pic was real or a net pic. No one said the girl was ugly.<P>And as for whether or not that is my girlfriend... there are times when I wish it wasn't! hehe But I have to live with my life being public so I have very little to hide. It is one of the bad sides of my career.<P>I did say that they would grow up and realize that it didn't make them cool so yes, I admit that we had our day. Luckily, I never did get into those things much.<P>And yes, I did get in a bad mood immediately when I came in here this morning and every post I read was slamming people. Sure, I voice my opinions from time to time, but they are very seldom personal. I always stand up for people's rights to say whatever they want as long as they aren't hurting anyone else. Disagree but don't attack. And there comes a time when you see people being attacked that you have to step up.<P>Fierobaby was not the first or the last to thing that the picture that started this thread was a fake, but she is the one who was put up to comparison and ridiculed. And I think that was just mean. And I had just come from the other post where a guy was called a geek by a chunky girl that had no room talking about anyone!<P>I'm wondering whatever happened to "If you don't have anything nice to say, just don't say anything."<BR><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/songman_1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A>||||reg||1
Z||000075||Stage-2GT||07-28-2001||11:14 AM|||| DOH!!!! Did you say "Chunky Girl"? Gotcha!!!<BR>Look man, it's all good. I couldn't hardly post a pic of you and make the comparison. Let me break it down for you.<BR>  On this forum, the females have this tendancy to think that their sh1t don't stink. Also they know that because they are women, that if someone slaps them in the face, there will be a hero along any second to save their arse. I mean be honest, if it was a comparison between two guys, you wouldn't have much to say and niether would I. This fella just wanted to post a pic of his GF, weather real or Memorex and Fierobaby's post went beyond stating doubt but got into him personally. If this guys bugs her so, then why even read his threads? Just a thought. Songman, your cool dude and you have a very chivalrous attitude. I can respect that. But remember not every damsel in distress really wants to be rescued.<P>S2GT <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif"><P>||||reg||1
Z||000076||fierobaby||07-28-2001||11:28 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Stage-2GT:<BR><B> <BR>  On this forum, the females have this tendancy to think that their sh1t don't stink. Also they know that because they are women, that if someone slaps them in the face, there will be a hero along any second to save their arse. <P>S2GT  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif"><BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P> for your info no I don't think like that Songman took that all up on his own and I thank him for defending me. and no I am no jealous I don't care if people don't find me hot or pretty or whatever else you want to say... I'm pretty confident about how I look and unlike some I don't go for looks I go for personality and weather you believe that or not I don't care... because you don't matter to me.<BR><P>------------------<BR><FONT COLOR="LETTER"> AIM: Fierobaby87<BR>http://angelfire.com/sports/sfiero </FONT><BR>         <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/cfiero.JPG"> ||||reg||1
Z||000077||Stage-2GT||07-28-2001||11:42 AM||||  Fierobaby, if you didn't care you wouldn't reply like you did. As for confidence in yourself and how you look, it's my trained opinion that a statement like that only proves the lack there of. <BR>  Now, I never said anything about the way you look. But by puting your picture side by side with another woman, naturaly, you and others made that assumption on your own. Personaly I find just about any woman under 200lbs is attractive in some way. <BR>  As for your apparent need to act snotty, that validates my previous statement about the confidence issue. Think about that. <BR>  Who knows if that is Santa Cruzers GF or not? And what does it matter? It probably is and he's proud of the fact that she is what he wants. Guys are guys and will naturaly be critical and suspicious of what another guys claims, naure, machismo, what ever. But you jumped in and berated SC for reasons other than those posted on this topic. You thought you might make your point by showing indifference and spite towards that which he was proud of. That in itself, makes you the attacker. <BR>  Man I would hate to see what you all would think of my girlfriend.<P>S2GT  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif"><P>Ok, here's a pic of my GF gettin out of our pool. Rip away!!!<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/GFPOOL!.jpg"> <BR>  <p>[This message has been edited by Stage-2GT (edited 07-28-2001).]||||reg||1
