Z||000079||maryjane||07-28-2001||11:17 PM||||well, this one went south in a hurry. There are enough REAL issues in the world to debate besides whether or not a pic is real  or who looks better.Thoughts on ANYONE'S  personal appearance should be kept to one's self. When we start making negative comments about gf's,bf's, or family member's looks, I think we've crossed the line. There have been things said here on both sides that would never be spoken if we were face to face. Lets let this one end before irrepairable damage and hurt feelings go too far. My opinion, all women are beautiful. I hope Cliff closes this thread soon.<BR>Don||||reg||1
